# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/)
#
# Contact consolidation: /book was merged into the canonical single-intent
# /contact page. 301 so inbound links and SEO equity transfer. Cloudflare Pages
# carries the original query string through to the destination, so attribution
# deep links such as /book?from=assessment land on /contact?from=assessment and
# the ?from= context banner still fires.
/book   /contact   301
